<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'A little space for you' }) %>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero wrap">
<div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> YOUR WELL-BEING BELONGS HERE</p><h1>You don’t have to<br>have it all<br><em>figured out.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">Some days feel lighter. Others, a little heavier.<br>This is a space to pause, find support, and take<br class="desktop-break"> the next small step — at your own pace.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#check-in">Take a moment for you <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/about">Get to know us <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><p class="hero-note"><span aria-hidden="true">♡</span> No pressure. No perfect way to begin.</p></div>
<div class="hero-art" role="img" aria-label="An illustrated sun rising above rolling green hills, with the reminder: growing at your own pace."><div class="art-grain"></div><span class="art-label">ROOM TO BREATHE</span><div class="sun"></div><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="hill hill-back"></div><div class="hill hill-middle"></div><div class="hill hill-front"></div><div class="plant"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="art-spark spark-one">✳</span><span class="art-spark spark-two">✧</span><div class="art-caption">Growing.<br><em>At your own pace.</em></div><span class="art-bottom">ONE DAY AT A TIME <span>↗</span></span></div>
</section>
<section class="check-in wrap" id="check-in" aria-labelledby="check-in-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CHECK-IN</p><h2 id="check-in-heading">How are you feeling today?</h2><p>All feelings are welcome here.</p></div><div class="mood-area"><div class="moods" role="group" aria-label="Choose how you feel"><% [{name:'Low',face:'︵',color:'pink'}, {name:'A little off',face:'﹏',color:'peach'}, {name:'Okay',face:'—',color:'yellow'}, {name:'Good',face:'◡',color:'sage'}, {name:'Great',face:'ᴗ',color:'green'}].forEach(mood => { %><button class="mood" data-mood="<%= mood.name %>" aria-pressed="false"><span class="face <%= mood.color %>" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><b><%= mood.face %></b></span><span><%= mood.name %></span></button><% }); %></div><p class="privacy-note">Just for this moment. Your answer isn’t saved or sent.</p></div><div class="mood-response" id="mood-response" role="status" hidden></div><noscript><p>Take a quiet moment to name how you feel. Enable JavaScript to use the interactive check-in.</p></noscript></section>
<section class="small-steps wrap" id="small-steps"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SMALL STEPS, A LITTLE MORE SPACE</p><h2>Start wherever you are.</h2></div><p>You don’t have to do everything.<br>One small thing is enough for now.</p></div><div class="cards"><article class="resource-card lavender"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span class="tag">PAUSE</span></div><h3>A moment to breathe</h3><p>Step away from the rush with a simple, one-minute breathing timer.</p><button class="card-link" id="open-breathing">Let’s slow down <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><noscript><p>Pause here for a minute and breathe at your own comfortable pace.</p></noscript></article><article class="resource-card peach-card"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">☷</span><span class="tag">UNDERSTAND</span></div><h3>Make room for your mind</h3><p>Get to know mental well-being, without the complicated language.</p><a class="card-link" href="/about#understand">Explore mental well-being <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article><article class="resource-card green-card"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">♡</span><span class="tag">CONNECT</span></div><h3>You don’t have to go alone</h3><p>Find a listening ear and a place to start when you need some support.</p><a class="card-link" href="/contact">Find your support <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article></div></section>
<section class="kind-note wrap"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p>You’re allowed to take your time.<br>There’s no deadline for becoming yourself.</p><small>A GENTLE REMINDER, JUST FOR YOU</small></section>
</main>
<dialog id="breathing-dialog" aria-labelledby="breathing-title"><button class="close-dialog" aria-label="Close breathing timer">×</button><p class="eyebrow">A MINUTE FOR YOURSELF</p><h2 id="breathing-title">Let’s slow down.</h2><p>Follow the gentle rhythm, or breathe at your own pace.<br>Stop whenever you like.</p><div class="breath-circle" id="breath-circle"><span id="breath-phase" role="status">Ready?</span></div><p id="breath-time">60 seconds · no breath holds</p><button class="button" id="start-breathing">Begin breathing</button></dialog>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
